OL,3,AUK announces sanctions on West Bank
OL,4,Asettlements prompting furious Israeli
OL,5,Aresponse
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's Foreign Minister Gideon Saar
OL,8,Fresponded by accusing him of spreading
OL,9,Fan "outrageous lie" and announced
OL,10,Fcounter-measures including shutting the
OL,11,FUK's consulate in East Jerusalem.
OL,13,FThe UK sanctions will ban settlement
OL,14,Fgoods but also act against companies
OL,15,Fand individuals providing services for
OL,16,Fsettlement expansion.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
