OL,3,AMore flight delays expected after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FIts boss Martin Rolfe apologised,
OL,8,Ftelling the BBC there would be a full
OL,9,Finvestigation into what had gone wrong,
OL,10,Fafter Nats said resolving the issue had
OL,11,Ftaken "longer than hoped".
OL,13,FWith few aircraft able to take off, it
OL,14,Fis understood landings were restricted,
OL,15,Fleading to some flights being unable to
OL,16,Fdepart overseas airports.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
