OL,3,AArgentina to file criminal case against
OL,4,Aoil company operating in Falklands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Argentine government has said that
OL,7,Fit will file criminal charges against
OL,8,Foil company Navitas Petroleum for
OL,9,Foperating in seas off the Falkland
OL,10,FIslands.
OL,12,FThe move came just days after Argentine
OL,13,FPresident Javier Milei said he would
OL,14,Fsanction oil companies drilling in the
OL,15,FBritish overseas territory in the
OL,16,Fsouth-west Atlantic Ocean.
OL,18,FReacting to the news, Foreign Office
OL,19,FMinister Kirsty McNeill insisted that
OL,20,Fthere could be "no doubt" about the
OL,21,FBritish government's commitment to the
OL,22,FFalkland Islanders.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
